From 2864a90318c3cf0fdf0e46aec9b1494a6a06aa8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mason <masond3v@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:25:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 204/204] msvcrt: Implement _strerror_s.

ucrtbase and msvcr80 to msvcr120 exported _strerror_s as a stub, so a
program that formats an error message with it aborted. GTA V Enhanced's
Epic Games launcher (PlayGTAV.exe) calls it while it prepares the Epic
launch, and stopped there before the Rockstar Games Launcher started.

The message is "str: <message for errno>", or the message alone when
str is NULL or empty, with no trailing newline, truncated to the buffer
like strerror_s.
